    {
      "id": "I_kwDOKIwiaM7nwP8s",
      "title": "Update OP Mainnet Node Snapshot page",
      "author": "sbvegan",
      "number": 1973,
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/docs",
      "body": "## Description\nUpdate the OP Mainnet node snapshot documentation so it lives in the correct OP Mainnet section and reflects current snapshot availability for op-reth.\n\nCurrent page:\n- https://docs.optimism.io/node-operators/guides/management/snapshots\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- The snapshot documentation is moved under the **OP Mainnet** section (information architecture updated appropriately)\n- Redirects are updated so existing links to the current URL continue to work (redirect list updated)\n- The page includes up-to-date information about the new **reth snapshots** hosted at **https://datadirs.optimism.io**\n- **op-reth** guidance is reflected (which snapshot to use + any relevant caveats/steps)\n- Any internal references to the old location are updated to the new location\n\n## User stories\n- As an OP Mainnet node operator running op-reth, I want clear snapshot guidance so I can bootstrap quickly and correctly.\n\n## Resources and support\n- Existing docs page: https://docs.optimism.io/node-operators/guides/management/snapshots\n- Snapshot hosting: https://datadirs.optimism.io\n\n## Action items\n- Decide the new target location under OP Mainnet and move the page\n- Add/confirm redirects from the old path to the new path\n- Add a section for reth snapshots (datadirs.optimism.io) and op-reth-specific instructions\n- Update any links in related node operator docs that point to the old page\n",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-02T23:53:56Z",
      "closedAt": "2026-02-10T17:46:28Z",
      "state": "CLOSED",
      "commentCount": 0
    }
